@Thuddle.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5208

GET {{Thuddle.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

# ─── Raffles ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@eventId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@raffleId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@userId   = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### List raffles for an event
GET {{Thuddle.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/raffles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a raffle
POST {{Thuddle.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/raffles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mystery Box Raffle",
  "description": "<p>Win a mystery board game bundle!</p>",
  "pricePerTicket": 2.50,
  "selfReportingEnabled": false
}

### Set tickets for a participant
PUT {{Thuddle.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/raffles/{{raffleId}}/entries/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tickets": 3
}

### Start drawing (Open → Drawing)
POST {{Thuddle.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/raffles/{{raffleId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Draw a winner (weighted, server-side RNG)
POST {{Thuddle.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/raffles/{{raffleId}}/draw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get draw history
GET {{Thuddle.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/raffles/{{raffleId}}/draws
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
